书的少女。最早登场于《东方怪绮谈》，后来在《东方妖妖梦》中再次登场，获得了不错的人气。人物设定上旧五作和新作有较大区别，怪绮谈中设定爱丽丝是魔族（魔界人），但新作设定她“原本是人类，经过修行后就成为了称为「魔法使」的种族”。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796","value":"魔法使"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796","value":"操控人偶程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796","value":"操纵魔法程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/afbe91c817a0795a52ff7b9e241d9a5d519667ce8f7927672bd25dddff296112.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/81/813408c8cffd5267b40d160885859319fb88a8487926f1878d75702aca8a3f72.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10813","characterName":"みま","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10813","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1157"},{"characterId":"10813","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"}]},"originalCharacterName":"みま","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10813","value":"恶灵(?)"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4a327a71bc2433171ad52a464bc914c1c3290b967f6a7d7d0c3adae24a291943.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/9860e765d1bc9df53a5cd5202b92b8bb24da770bc00c6fc8f355c42049a9ba0c.webp","width":191,"height":193,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10822","characterName":"かざみ ゆうか","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10822","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"10822","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"}]},"originalCharacterName":"かざみ ゆうか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"四季花之主，一年到头都生活在花之中，一旦有人类妖怪闯入，就会不问缘由以强大的力量将其消灭。与其说是花之妖怪，倒不如说在大自然的化身更贴切。和妖精不同，也和之前介绍的妖怪不可同级而语，是极其危险的妖怪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平时一直生活在花众中，看起来很和蔼，但对其他生物一点也不留情。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10822"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10822","value":"妖怪"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10822","value":"操控花程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c932e21e4a9b9533bd50c024386dcbf0cbaa8bfba98feaa37b1f1e4b3e9db5f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e386f15e0f5557a742cc71dc4d30f529eda0db295ed59a95e8365eb309625555.webp","width":225,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10999","characterName":"げんじい","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10999","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1157"},{"characterId":"10999","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"}]},"originalCharacterName":"げんじい","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"种族：龟(?)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"职业：马"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前五作时灵梦的座驾(?)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"灵梦在修行途中把他抓回来当坐骑"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为前五作的灵梦不能飞，所以作为魔法少女吉祥物（误）辅助角色出场"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"乘坐方式是以大字型趴上去(无误)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"第二作时很多话说,但之后再没有说话了"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"很明显的大M（误）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神主于2004年明治大学中的talk show「东方の夜明け」曾说过，「现在它大概是在那个神社的池中静静地生活着。」，也成为了神主承认的第三个在现今幻想乡中生活着的旧作人物？ ！"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCha